River: emit pointer_position on motion without a manage sequence

river_seat_v1.pointer_position is otherwise only sent during manage
(hover change, key, map, …). A pixel loupe needs layout coordinates on
every cursor move. The protocol forbids starting manage for motion
alone; sending the event outside manage is allowed.

